(text "DOTECH HMT500  -  Oil Moisture Transmitter  -  Schematic v0.7" (at 30.48 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0135a817-2d1b-5c24-b8c9-b50d7fb2525e))
(text "v0.5: J1 = JST GH 1.25 mm 8P side entry (SM08B-GHS-TB), harness W-2 to M12 8P; J5 chassis spring contact (was M12 shell pin)." (at 30.48 203.708 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 192e0a59-3546-57ea-90ea-961b942b008e))
(text "v0.4: J3 = JST SH 1.0 mm 4P (SM04B-SRSS-TB side entry, v0.5) for sensor harness W-1 direct from HTX99R (no feedthrough, mech Rev F); Pt1000 2-wire (Kelvin split at J3 pads)." (at 30.48 209.296 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 25cb4657-7c64-5697-93c3-7d625ea7215c))
(text "v0.3: MCU STM32G0B1CCT3 (LQFP48, -40..125 C, in-house part); TPS26600PWP official pinout; single axial PCB 57x23 (mech Rev C)." (at 30.48 214.884 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c4209203-4276-5605-becd-bf8b3acbeb3c))
(text "Signal flow: J1 field connector -> protection -> eFuse -> 5 V buck -> 3.3 V LDO; sensor head J3 -> PCAP04 / ADS1220 -> MCU -> DAC8760 x2 / THVD2450 -> J1" (at 30.48 220.472 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c9849e73-29ca-5ed7-b496-3ce0d012fd8c))
(text "Outputs: RS-485 Modbus RTU + 2x analog (4-20 mA / 0-20 mA / 0-10 V / 0-5 V selectable).  Supply 12-30 V DC." (at 30.48 226.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f81220da-233e-59a6-9404-ce8244e9c80d))
(text "Protection target: any pin pair +/-30 V continuous (miswiring), surge +/-1 kV, ESD +/-8 kV contact." (at 30.48 231.648 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ee99cd3a-917c-5817-ae28-79f99d02824c))
(text "Power symbols: GND, +3V3, +3V3A (analog 3.3 V), +5V, VIN_P (protected input), CHASSIS.  Inter-sheet signals: global labels." (at 30.48 237.236 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 16811ae8-69b7-50e3-8bc5-1be1543d9739))
(text "v0.6: parts cleanup (-16: pull-ups R11-15, LED D3/R16, RS-485 R60/61 D60/61, FB2 C19 C11 C2 C6); PCB temperature = ADS1220 + MCU internal sensors." (at 30.48 242.824 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c78f7876-1536-595c-9cac-5cf81555b7e3))
(text "v0.7: DAC8760 datasheet pinout (HTSSOP-24 PWP); +VSENSE via OPA197 follower (U12/U13); external ISET-R 15k 0.1%; DACs on SPI2 daisy chain, common DAC_LATCH." (at 30.48 248.412 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 879b047e-df8f-51f9-8d65-4809faed8586))
